<title>AUSTRIA: Nigeria says Thurs OPEC talks may be over before l.</title>
<headline>Nigeria says Thurs OPEC talks may be over before l.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nigerian oil minister Dan Etete said that OPEC talks on Thursday may be over before lunch.</p>
<p>Previously Algerian oil minister Amar Makhloufi told reporters on his return from Wednesday's session would end &quot;sooner than you think.&quot;</p>
<p>Ministers said a consensus was emerging for an output rollover from the group.</p>
<p>-- Vienna Newsroom +431 713 2034</p>
